# Git LFS is NOT required: every file in this repo is under GitHub's 100 MB hard limit.
# The largest file is print/mods/Twiglet/source/blender/body_v334.blend (59 MB, over GitHub's 50 MB warning).
# The largest STLs are head_lower (20 MB) and head_upper (15.6 MB).
#
# To use LFS (recommended for the .blend, which will grow with each version), install git-lfs and run
#   git lfs install
# before the first commit, then uncomment these lines:
# *.blend filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.stl   filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
#
# git-lfs is not installed on the staging box, so this repo was staged without LFS.

*.stl     binary
*.blend   binary
*.npy     binary
*.png     binary
*.xcf     binary
*.drawio  text
*.md      text
*.py      text
*.xml     text
*.json    text
*.csv     text
*.sh      text eol=lf
